    "text": "\u00d0is synd \u00fea lond gem\u00e6ro \u00fee gebyria\u00f0 into codestune.\n\u00c6rest on gytincges \u00e6welm.\nOf gytincges \u00e6wylm on no\u00f0 dene on \u00feone grenan weg \u00fe on \u00feone haran stan.\nOf \u00feam haran stane andlang grenan weges on scepe clif.\nAndlang scepe clifes inon meos m\u00e6re, of meos m\u00e6re andlang dene on geolowon ford.\nOf geolowon forda on \u00ferist longan dene, ondlong \u00feristlongan dene to brocces sl\u00e6de.\nOf brocces sl\u00e6de ondlong ecce \u00fe on \u00fea twegen \u00feornas.\nOf \u00feam twam \u00feornan on wad beorh, of wad beorhce on lafercan beorh.\nOf lafercan beorhge a bi \u00feam \u00e6cran heafdan \u00fe on scyttan f\u00e6n.\nOf scyttan f\u00e6n \u00fe on gytinc ondlong \u00fe eft on gytincges \u00e6wylm.",
